+build output hash
+`e1f281f8580dcfb8d56d6e12cd47626784f6e863248a029b08a262ea28e48339`.
+
+### Source-rule/obligation bijection
+
+The independently established domain set is genuinely empty. The following
+ordered lists are all exactly `[]`:
